  <UserdefinedSymbols/>
  <Comments>Original table built live for Batman: Arkham Asylum GOTY Steam v1.1.1.0. Table revision: v6.
Target executable: ShippingPC-BmGame.exe (32-bit)
Expected SHA-256: 4DAC1F5E2AC6710B7378FDCE74601F616F4753E3756CB5FDA63C7519CC2EB028

This v6 uses Unreal Engine 3 object reflection and live class discovery. Live writes verify the UObject registry, expected class, and fresh scan snapshot; restores are identity-checked to avoid reused streamed-object addresses. No console commands and no copied trainer scripts.
Enable the green initializer first. Entries marked [Test] need validation in their relevant gameplay mode.</Comments>
</CheatTable>
